window.products.push({"id":569246,"name":"Heated Blanket Electric Throw with Double-Flannel, Soft Cozy Electric Blanket for Home Office Use, 60\"x50\" Fast Heating Heated Throw 4 Timer & 3 Heat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rZ5NQ33sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note: Since the product is vacuum packaging, please be sure to make the product not in using for more than half an hour after disassembling the vacuum bag, otherwise it will affect its service life. ☀️☀️ SOFT AND COZY - The heated throw blanket is made of Premium flannel, excellent warmth preservation and skin-friendly experience. No cold feel while touching even heating not started yet. Evenly distributed heating wires can heat up faster, ideal for using on couch, sofa and bed, or to wrap up in while watching television, reading a book or just relaxing and soothe aching muscles, also makes it a good choice for office, bring you a warm and comfortable life experience. ☀️☀️ 100% SAFE PROTECTION - HeaBoom heated blanket was developed by a team of professional engineers and has undergone rigorous laboratory tests which were ETL and FCC certified. Our user-friendly 3-hour auto-off protection prevents unnecessary power consumption in case you forget to turn off your heating blanket. And our smart overheating protection technology ensures 100% safety at all times. HeaBoom Heated Blanket allows you to enjoy a restful night of sleep. ☀️☀️ ULTRA HUGE HEATING AREA & EVEN WARMTH - Different from the traditional electric blanket, we specially extended the length of our heating wire by 18%, offering an unprecedented large heating area. The heating range is larger and denser, giving you full-body warmth. C-color electric blanket also utilizes the latest constant temperature heating technology, you will always feel stable warmth without sudden temperature fluctuation. 🌱🌱FAREWELL TO EXPENSIVE ELECTRICITY BILLS - When you are in the cold winter, heating is indispensable. HeaBoom electric blanket will help you save an expensive electricity bill in the cold winter. 12 timer options to automatically turn off(1-12h) the electric heated blanket, save more electricity, 5 min fast heating. ☀️☀️ 3 HEATING LEVELS & 4 TIMER SETTINGS - Our electric heated blanket throw has 3 different heat settings, ranging from 40 to 60℃ (104°F to 140 °F) with one button. It’s the fast heating function can help you against the cold weather and obtain a comfort situation in a very short time. And provides 4 timer auto shut off (8/6/4/2hrs). This heating blanket comes with auto off when the temperature is over 60℃(140°F) or timed out, which is very safe and energy saving. ☀️☀️ MACHINE WASHABLE - In cold water so you don’t need to worry about stains or dirt. This electric blanket can be put in the machine and thoroughly washed (Note: Please detach the controller before cleaning). Line drying and tumble drying on low heat are both applicable. For better performance, gently stretch the heated blanket to its original size after washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rZ5NQ33sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeaBoom","source_asin":"B0BJZQWTJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZQWTJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZQWTJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
