window.products.push({"id":569369,"name":"Easy Clean Yerba Mate Bombilla for Gourd Drinking Straw with Cleaning Brush and Removable Filter Head (The Fray (Gray))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZEQ0PSKL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Quality Yerba Supply's Bombilla has stood the test of time. Mate is an artisanal tea that deserves artisanal accessories. We've tested several different models and selected the best of the best. This straw is made from stainless steal, and will not clog. Using our Bombilla New drinkers have a tendency to stir their yerba mate--You should never stir your Yerba Mate tea with your bombilla, as this will create a clog for any straw and you will ingest the tea particles. Design: -Our design process revolves around simplicity, functionality, and sustainability. -We've included Yerba Supply's Bombilla Cleaning Pipet to help keep your bombilla in perfect condition. We've also built in aesthetically pleasing bead to help hold the bombilla up while you drink to prevent burning while the hot tea goes through the yerba straw.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZEQ0PSKL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yerba Supply","source_asin":"B019BPU3QA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019BPU3QA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019BPU3QA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
