window.products.push({"id":569426,"name":"Battilo Home Navy Throw Blanket with Fringe Geometric Bed Blue Throws Spring Decorative Large Throw for Couch Sofa Indoor Outdoor (Navy, 52\"x80\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AnvZ70fbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acrylic SIZE & MATERIAL – Woven of environmental and 100% high quality acrylic to create a soft and cozy silky touch. This throw blanket is breathable, anti-shed and anti-sunlight with excellent fastness, measures 52 x 80 in, weighs 1.8 lbs. COLORFUL – Different color choices for festivals, ages and people. You can get a perfect decoration for your home. Red throw blanket for Christmas, orange throw for Fall decoration, yellow and green throw for St. Patrick’s Day, pink throw for Valentine’s Day. *The color would be different due to screen display setting. STYLISH – Skillfully crafted with geometric pattern and rolled fringed edges for a stylish beautiful finish. This farmhouse fringe throw blanket is suitable for all indoor and outdoor spaces like living room, bedroom, camping, hotel, park. VERSITILE – Battilo fringe throw can satisfy daily usage. It’s perfect for snuggling up on couch and sofa. This afghan style blanket can be used as a bed scarf or bed runners. You can use it as a shawl when you are in garden with families and friends. EASY CARE & SATISFACTION GUARANTEED- Machine wash colors separately wash in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, low iron. Battilo guarantees to provide 1-Month return and replacement service & life-time free customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AnvZ70fbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Battilo","source_asin":"B0B63J188C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63J188C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63J188C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":569427,"name":"AIRMSEN Hot Air Popper Popcorn Maker, Popcorn Machine with 2 in 1 Measuring Cup to Measure Corn Kernels & Melt Butter, 98% Poping Rated Popcorn Popper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71stPSRZ2+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quick and Easy Snack - Simply measure and add your popcorn kernels to the high capacity heating chamber, then push the One-Touch start button, for Hot and fresh popcorn in minutes. So you can make crisp, tasty popcorn for all your family and friends in just a few minutes! Perfect for movie night, family get-togethers, parties! Fresher & Healthier - No more unnecessary saturated fats, AIRMSEN Popcorn Machine uses hot air to pop popcorn. Deliciously low-fat and all natural, free from oils and artificial flavors, healthier to eat! Of course, if you crave a more flavorful snack, butter it up or add salt and flavorings after the corn has popped. Multifunctional Measuring Cup - The included measuring cup doubles as a butter melting tray on the top of the machine - simply add a tablespoon of butter while your popcorn pops, popper has just enough heat to melt butter and pour once melted for movie theater-style popcorn. Compact Design - This popcorn maker is small and portable, so you can take it with you even when you’re traveling. It's perfect for college dorm rooms, RVs & campers, and more! Its sleek design and trendy color options will accent any kitchen space; makes a perfect gift for Christmas, home-warming, birthday, Valentine's Day. Easy To Clean - Since this popcorn machine pops with hot air, cleaning is a snap. Simply wipe the air popper popcorn maker with a damp cloth and wipe dry. So simple and fun the kids will be thrilled to use over and over. Includes - AIRMSEN mini popcorn machine is backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty and includes a measuring cup for popcorn kernels and melting butter, user manual (all non-electric parts are dishwasher safe). If you need any help, our professional customer support is always here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71stPSRZ2+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIRMSEN","source_asin":"B09V4DTQNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V4DTQNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V4DTQNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
