window.products.push({"id":569492,"name":"Christmas Dog Shower Curtain for Kids Cartoon Dog Animal Shower Curtains for Bathroom Accessories 3D Printing Hilarious Pet Bath Decor Fabric with 12 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zOak0gOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester ฅ 【QUALITY MATERIAL DOG SHOWER CURTAIN】- Polyester Fabric.The Christmas dogs shower curtain is a light-weight fabric shower curtain,but it's well made and durable ,soft touch imported which promotes water bead formation and is made to withstand damp, moisture rich bathroom environments; Drapes beautifully for a clean fresh look in your bathroom. ฅ 【STANDARD SIZE】- Usually the curtain is 3cm-5cm (1-2inch) away from the ground, whether it is a straight rod or a U-shaped rod, the width should be more than the actual width of 20-30CM(8-12inch) or so, the shower curtain can have wrinkled beauty and three-dimensional shape,so our Christmas dogs is 72 \"x 72\" / 180 x 180 cm, which meets the needs of most bathrooms. ฅ 【MERRY CHRISTMAS DOG 】- In the Christmas atmosphere, two lovely Labradors and Boston terrier, making your bathroom full of energy and fun. This shower curtain with lovely dogs is very suitable for families with children and people who like dogs. It can be decorated in the main bathroom, guest bathroom or children's bathroom. ฅ 【EXCELLENT WORKMANSHIP DOG SHOWER CURTAIN】- Reinforced button holes work with most types of shower hooks and rings for quick and simple installation; Top hem is reinforced to hold up to long term use. It comes with 12 pcs free plastic shower curtain hooks. ฅ 【BEST CUSTOMER CARE】- We want to make sure that the products you receive are of high quality and free from any defects. We will check every shower curtain carefully before delivery to make sure your shower curtain is well printed. If you have any questions about your purchase, please feel free to contact us and we will try our best to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zOak0gOsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DZGlobal","source_asin":"B08NY1YHN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NY1YHN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NY1YHN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
