window.products.push({"id":569702,"name":"Burrito Buddy Silicone Cookware - Burrito Warmer - Heating Sleeve for Frozen Burritos - Burrito Heater - No Waste - BPA Free - Dishwasher Safe - 2 pac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fQ+J9dygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Original burrito buddy burrito warming sleeve makes cooking a frozen burrito a breeze! No more paper towels that stick and leave dried out tortillas. No more spills in the microwave. The innovate burrito buddy silicone heating sleeve microwave allows for perfect heating of a frozen burrito with no sticking and perfect results every time. It's the kitchen item you never realized you needed!  Never Peel Paper Towel Off Your Cooked Burrito Again! A simple, waste free way to transform a burrito frozen - to perfectly cooked every time. No paper towels or plates needed. The Burrito Buddy is made of non-stick food safe silicone that not only helps heat evenly but also lets your burrito slide out easily after cooking. Heating microwave burritos has never been easier! No Hot Spots or Cold Filling - The Burrito Buddy tortilla, burrito and taco cooker heats food evenly - Use the power of naturally occurring steam to cook your burrito all the way through and contain any spills - Silicone Sleeve Microwave Burrito cooker , container and burrito maker is perfect for frozen sandwiches too! Easy to Store and Clean - The Burrito Buddy is a microwave safe heating container - a tortilla, burrito or taco container that can easily be washed by hand or in the dishwasher. It's open on both ends to ensure no hard to clean areas. Non-stick food safe silicone lets your pocket of hot food slide out easily after cooking. Say Goodbye to Burned Fingers - Use the Burrito Buddy burrito, tortilla and taco warmer to hold and eat your burrito. You can even use the burrito holder to keep your hands clean and fingertips cool while eating your burrito Environmentally Friendly - BPA Free Food Safe Silicone - Reusable - Waste-Free - No paper towels or plates needed -Reuse burrito heating dish microwave - Reusable Microwave Safe Cookware is Better Value - Nothing to Throw Away  So put a Burrito Buddy in your shopping cart today. You'll be so glad","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fQ+J9dygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"burrito buddy","source_asin":"B09FS7BKVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FS7BKVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FS7BKVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
