window.products.push({"id":569745,"name":"Inofia 6 inch Queen mattresses - Gel Memory Foam Mattress in a Box, 7 Zone Queen Size Mattresses with Breathable Cover,CertiPUR-US Certified,Pressure ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y5oCsUGGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note: Please allow 48-72 hours for your new Inofia Mattress to regain its full shape. The expansion time may vary as per the temperature, in warm room, it may expand faster, while in cold room, it may take a bit longer. [Breathable & soft cover] The soft fabric cover for 6 inch memory foam mattress improves the breathability and natural moisture control of your sleep environment. It also creates an air layer at the queen mattress surface and offers more air-flow, which can quickly dissipate heat, provides a comfortable sleeping. [7 zones targeted support] Inofia queen size mattress is designed for proper spinal alignment and pressure relieving. Studies shows that each part of human body needs varying support, so we designed this 7-zone foam mattress which provides targeted support for each part, so that people can sleep more relaxed and comfortable. [Cool sleeping experience] Premium memory foam mattress is infused with advanced gel material that reduces some of the heat retention to create a more comfortable sleep environment. Open-cell design helps air flow more efficiently through the bed, provides a cooler and drier sleep. [Suitable for all sleepers] Our memory mattress of queen size is suitable for stomach sleepers, side sleepers, and back sleepers. No matter what position you prefer, this medium-firm mattress will transform the way you sleep and put an end to that tossing and turning that keeps you awake. [Queen Bed in Box] Each queen bed is compressed, rolled, and comes in an easy-to-manage box for convenient shipping. We offer full 101 sleep nights trial. Please feel free to contact us anytime if there's any question or problem. Investing in quality sleep is essential for overall health and well-being.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y5oCsUGGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inofia","source_asin":"B09T35QX39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T35QX39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T35QX39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
