window.products.push({"id":569968,"name":"Ceramic and Cork Coasters for Drinks with Holder - Easy to Clean Moisture Absorbent Coaster Set with Heat Resistant Durable Cork Bottom - Modern Coast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sWYsd3ngS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOISTURE ABSORBENT CORK BOTTOM: Tired of finding ring marks all over your wood furniture? Our absorbent ceramic and cork coasters come in vivid, colorful designs and will protect your beautiful tables from rings, spots, and other stains. Unlike other brands of coasters that get easily stained or stick to the bottom of your drink, our ceramic and cork bottom coasters are thick and non-slip, effectively preventing stains and spillage. BEAUTIFUL VIVID DESIGN WITH COLORFUL PATTERNS: Our coasters come in unique decorative designs which will make for the perfect tableside display in your home. The high-quality glaze on the top keeps the design bright and protects from discoloration even after repeated use and cleaning. Your guests will be impressed by these beautiful coasters! DURABLE AND UNBREAKABLE: Stop spending money on flimsy coasters that break after a couple of uses. Choose our thick and durable ceramic coasters that will not break even after repeated use. Our heavy-duty coasters are the perfect size for most cups, glasses, and mugs making them ideal for daily use. Prevent scratches from your tables, kitchen tops, and bar counters with our scratch-free and absorbent cork-bottomed coasters. CONVENIENT COASTER HOLDER MAKES ORGANIZATION A BREEZE: Beautiful as well as functional, our ceramic and cork coasters come with a handy holder, so that you never have to hurriedly search for them when guests come over. Using the holder will allow you to easily organize the coasters in your drawers, or them stack neatly on the counter or table when not in use. Great for both hot or cold drinks, our style of cork coaster is the preferred choice for restaurants, bars, weddings, banquets, and homes. Our vibrant cork coasters will become a conversation starter at your next event or party. Uniquely designed with colorful patterns, they will surely brighten up your living room. These cork coasters are not only beautiful, but also highly functional. These make the perfect housewarming gift for family and friends.Â Our big cork coasters are perfect for most cups, glasses and mugs. They can easily absorb drops, spillage, and other condensation to protect your furniture. Keep your furnishings free from rings and stains with our durable, anti-slip cork coasters. Try out our coasters today risk free!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sWYsd3ngS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooler Kitchen","source_asin":"B0861HJBF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-569968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0861HJBF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0861HJBF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
